      "id": 1,
      "text": "Sacramento sits on Pine Creek, a westward‑flowing stream that joins the Mahantango Creek watershed before reaching the Susquehanna River basin.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
